          <p>
            Read the table the other way round, too. With a standard 8-foot (96-inch) ceiling, almost
            anyone fits on almost any treadmill, which is why this is a basement and attic problem. At 7
            feet, a 6-foot-2 runner does not fit on any treadmill by this rule and should walk rather than
